{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And Joseph brought them out from beside his knees.</b> Because they were clinging to him when he embraced and kissed them, and now Joseph wanted to arrange them so that he would place his hand upon them — therefore he needed to bring them out from beside his knees and move them slightly apart, to set one at his one hand and the other at his other hand."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:14.304316944Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}